Welcome to MatchMuster! We’re delighted to have you and your team with us.

MatchMuster was created to make running a football team simpler, giving you one place to organise your players, fixtures and matchday responsibilities.

With MatchMuster Free, you can:

• Invite players and managers to your team
• Manage your squad and player availability
• Create fixtures and training sessions
• Select starters, substitutes, captains and set-piece takers
• Share team updates and important information
• Request and record Match Subs payments
• Keep track of match results and player statistics
• Run Player of the Match ratings and celebrate team awards
• Receive notifications about team activity

You can also try MatchMuster Plus, which gives managers additional tools to save time and understand their team better.

MatchMuster Plus includes:

• Automatic availability reminders
• Squad Analytics and player fitness records
• Match Subs payment analytics
• Club Finance tools for tracking income and expenses
• Recurring training sessions
• Advanced manager controls
• The ability to create and manage multiple teams

Players will never need to pay to join or use MatchMuster. MatchMuster Plus is completely optional and is designed for managers who want more support with their team administration.

To get started, invite your players using your team’s invite code, create your first fixture and ask the squad to confirm their availability.

If you have any questions or need help setting up your team, contact us at support@matchmuster.uk.

Welcome to the MatchMuster family. We’re excited to be part of your season.

